// # install/docs — Package Manual
//
// Logline: Per-package docs for how the toolchain lands on a machine. apt, dnf, pacman, and install.sh.
//
// Setup: RFC-0005. Website Source: openOODA/install/docs/. INSTALL.md is host residual. New docs are .oot. This repo is not `ooda install`.
//
// Beats:
//   1. surface.oot — distro surface and public install URL.
//   2. INSTALL.md — flags, ~/.openooda/ layout, three paths.
//
// The manual pages are .oot and .md, not .oo pages: a .oo page cannot import
// them, so this anchor documents the manual without importing it.
